<title>USA: Rotonics Manufacturing to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Rotonics Manufacturing to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>GARDENA, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rotonics Manufacturing Inc said its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 100,000 shares.</p>
<p>It said the program will remain open until further notice.</p>
</text>
